+To serve the REST API, UI, and gRPC endpoint over TLS, configure a certificate and private key:
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 443
+  grpc_port: 9000
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/server.crt
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/server.key
+```
+
+The certificate and key files must exist when Flipt starts. The HTTP and HTTPS ports select the REST API and UI listener for their respective protocol; gRPC uses `server.grpc_port`.
+
